  "problem": "The manager wants to determine the number of wooden tables the company should produce per week to make a weekly profit of $$4\\,800.$ The required number of wooden tables $x$ is the solution to the equation\n\n$$\n6{x}^{2}-360x+4\\,800=0.\n$$\n\nThis equation can be factored as $\\,$$6\\cdot ($\n{{field-1}} $)=0.$",
